        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer 2960, 2-3/4\" x  2-3/4\" Screen Door Spring Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFull Surface Single Acting Spring Hinge for Screen Doors. Door flange is surface applied to door. Jamb flange is surface applied to door jamb.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBommer 2960 Screen Door Spring Hinge permit doors automatically return to the closed position (Self Closing). Packaged  with #7 x 3/4\" wood mounting screws. The spring tension is not adjustable.\r\n<!-- If you need an adjustable tension hinge use <a href=\"/products/2-3-4-x-2-3-4-full-surface-screen-door-spring-hinge-pair-bommer-2920\"><b>Bommer 2920</b></a>. -->\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer made in the USA\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Bommer 2960 Screen Door Spring Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Height: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>Non-Adjustable Tension</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Type: Full Surface</li>\r\n<li>Door flange surface applied</li>\r\n<li>Jamb flange  surface applied</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/2960.pdf?v=1691094993\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer 2960 Dimensional  Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold as a Pair (2 Hinges).</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>***Link to Bommer 2960 Spring Hinge Replacement: \r\n<a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/2-34-x-2-12-full-surface-stainless-steel-spring-hinge-pair-dwd-b2960-1269478\">DWD-B2960 2-3/4 x 2-1/2 Screen Door Spring Hinge</b></a> \r\n</p>",
